        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Erich Raeder, Karl Dönitz, Adolf Hitler, Alfred von Tirpitz\n- Roles: Großadmiral, head of state of Germany\n\nFacts:\n- In 1939, Erich Raeder attained the naval rank of Großadmiral, or Grand Admiral.\n- Erich Raeder was the first person to hold the rank of Großadmiral since Alfred von Tirpitz.\n- Karl Dönitz briefly succeeded Adolf Hitler as the head of state of Germany.",
